# Balance on turn 5 with each player at two lands, two creatures and four cards in hand (Bot2's Sol Ring is neither a
# land nor a creature, so it is not counted). Nobody has more than the fewest of any kind, so nobody is asked and
# nothing is sacrificed or discarded - only Balance itself leaves Bot1's hand (it goes to the graveyard as it resolves).

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Plains
Balance
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Sol Ring
Island
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast

[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast

[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play

[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast

[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Balance.Cast

